OL,3,GNEWSAI hope Marvel fans accept my
OL,4,AScottish accent, says new star Ruaridh
OL,5,AMollica
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish actor Ruaridh Mollica has said
OL,8,Fhe hopes fans will accept his accent as
OL,9,Fhe stars in the latest addition to the
OL,10,FMarvel Cinematic Universe (MCU).
OL,12,FThe 27-year-old plays the speedster
OL,13,FTommy Maximoff in the new Disney+
OL,14,Fminiseries VisionQuest, which is based
OL,15,Fon the superhero comic book character
OL,16,FVision.
OL,18,FTommy is an 18-year-old orphan who is
OL,19,Fnewly out of the foster care system in
OL,20,FLondon but has memories of his mother
OL,21,Fand father - Avengers Wanda Maximoff
OL,22,Fand Vision.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
