OL,3,GNEWSAI hope Marvel fans accept my
OL,4,AScottish accent, says new star Ruaridh
OL,5,AMollica
OL,6,
OL,7,FMollica told The Saturday Show on BBC
OL,8,FRadio Scotland that speaking in his own
OL,9,Faccent helped him give the character a
OL,10,Ffuller personality.
